    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "When you donate to Westminster’s Annual Fund, you help to build a brighter future."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "While tuition covers the yearly operating costs of the school, it does not provide for growth and support in certain areas. With Annual Fund donations like yours, we are able to expand our facilities and develop new programs to enrich the lives of our students and faculty."
    },
