  {
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Because of Your Gifts"
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Thanks to the generosity of our community, this year’s Annual Fund made a meaningful impact across both campuses by enhancing fine arts spaces, upgrading athletic facilities, improving campus safety, and investing in infrastructure that supports daily student life. We were also able to expand our transportation capabilities with the addition of new vans, making it easier to serve students across programs and campuses. Annual Fund gifts also provided need-based tuition assistance, helping more families access a Christ-centered education."
    }
   ],
   "background": {
